#CHLOEAI:1
TYPE="stack_meta"
STACK="elixir-phoenix"
DISPLAY_NAME="Elixir / Phoenix"

DESCRIPTION:
Elixir web services and APIs with Phoenix Framework. Includes LiveView
for realtime UI if needed. OTP patterns for concurrency.

RECOMMENDED_TOOLS:
- Language:      Elixir 1.16+
- Runtime:       OTP 26+
- Framework:     Phoenix 1.7+
- Build:         mix
- Test:          ExUnit (built-in)
- Lint:          Credo
- Format:        mix format (built-in)
- Dialyzer:      Dialyxir for type specs

INIT_NOTES:
- init-project.sh copies code.chloeai → .claude/rules/code.chloeai
- init-project.sh copies tests.chloeai → .claude/rules/tests.chloeai
- Pin Elixir/OTP versions in .tool-versions (asdf) or .elixir-version
